{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de8adcbfd5d4fbf0e4a44fbe7d346d98d23509e53a86b8dbe260186f262e5075",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6074c82b2713d2ee331aebca2eedd4e70d8a9e1255f49598a2175b62c69ae884",
      "text": "开始运转的轻音部",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3af82b2958b8c206e30533789622502afd3aebf5f9e53279efd6864edd17e2b1",
      "text": "春名为避免留级而加入了轻音部。\n乐队成员终于集齐，\n大家开始商讨今后的活动。\n隼人提议参加高中生乐队大赛，\n然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6074c82b2713d2ee331aebca2eedd4e70d8a9e1255f49598a2175b62c69ae884",
      "text": "开始运转的轻音部",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1efc9f7c2a0ce82a3956a2bfd13c2193a34136bb765406b2afd2167ce55a61e",
      "text": "呃，轻音部，轻音部……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b58fc2643f816ac731fff9ba7415c99f32053227cc5f07fd0ed4fa735056513",
      "text": "说起来前几天碰到了要去轻音部的新生呢。\n那家伙顺利到达了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3f770deae14666335a40dcb53eff7ba6e29ad947a71fee81e625cf3e1a43cb5",
      "text": "哦，是这里。有人在吗——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c452d7c5215e9ac54b3f2084534f7603617a147fe9a432cbecc7cb8f901b7f80",
      "text": "有人，来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337dfc45f7edeb51ff63805a7458db3977e55ea0338413122a5e926f739f3913",
      "text": "哎！难道是第二个新部员！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db7b1ec0296ddd794d96e7205600827e81b3adea63e675f793afe089abae60a7",
      "text": "（咦。这个人，我好像在哪里见过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b037c9214e066d4d276949158e9a2187fc5a3bd3ab2ad968d0e0e87fd66a9223",
      "text": "啊——！是前几天的！\n给我指路的那位帅哥！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:443c7a7cdb108286fe38fe889f6f44de49a58815618e455b6d00381c5cbcbd9f",
      "text": "哦，精神满满的新生！\n你也加入轻音部了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a40a2d41cd9733abc72cdb6724e2c612ac387475acb962e2fd11e2d8f0cf6a",
      "text": "当然啦！……等等，“你也”的意思是。\n前辈也要加入轻音部吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f8173e5ca34fcfe0bc856cb11ffff893e9ae8f91e2f859c7a1db801d1d654f",
      "text": "不……其实我早就入部了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c9fa3f743aec4e40933c97d6442ab99257fcfb4b5de527d105d9d4434a477f",
      "text": "哎……是这样吗！？可我从没见过你啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fd341d9d1b7d784e77ce8a6b558c3a4b45ef067fbfe66f619e1f1ad7da32ac",
      "text": "幽灵……部员……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_a:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e89eb41f6e0af71d9e76e45467ab0c9827f12c23fd42cf9d1509c7f099dca3ed",
      "text": "……感觉又要多一个麻烦人物了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e20108b69065abd906b812da7d9fe9afadca45296cb46fe610ce0d9990b3b50",
      "text": "早就入部了，是什么意思啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4fc62e12f20beb4392eed5778c2ca421259b22103273dbc1a5d6101ad6bd124",
      "text": "哎呀，其实我是留级了两次的高二学生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1a07828f65fe3831e70fee393a05ac92c541ca6fb48c5baa1b4ddac46cd3bb3",
      "text": "我完全给忘了，\n不过高一的时候好像确实报了这个部。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201e387d3e1b49c7c1638a9dca6c3551743489675881e2b71cd22902d942cc92",
      "text": "最近才想起来，\n所以打算来参加一下活动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eff0ad6543c33db419c9b8ba6a11c2f48fbc76acc11c0c97cce9693227a2fbe8",
      "text": "原来跟我们同一年级啊。\n怪不得总觉得好像在哪里见过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3005713ea69ec2c6c4a461ce60f21d74ce8fc759b21eb66acce7cd09bc84938",
      "text": "虽然是前辈……但同级……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1683759ab34b396821c53896cbd352228a6adcb0392bb103b533db2e19d52ed",
      "text": "嘛，反正我也是第一次来活动室，\n就把我当成新部员看就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f9d8219a4bc7fb034e6f658e01e3703c6a84ba22bc9b0ca715ae3c75dadf685",
      "text": "我是若里春名。\n喜欢的东西是甜甜圈，讨厌的东西基本没有！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044f7f545c9a39fcf2ebf8ea27bf21aa72c96410eac04765272637474730cd52",
      "text": "擅长的事情是做发型……\n乐器的话今后会好好练的，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfc6e2182765671c4ff1cf46ca129d1272582a1c50fce84a3b3169737976583",
      "text": "（擅、“擅长的事情是做发型”……！？\n好时髦，感觉会很受女生欢迎……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a25553c00ac2fb4b6f806d8fff54858256096d1e54dcd582a53dd3baef48559",
      "text": "那个，剩下没人的位置是鼓手，\n这样没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a5cb4515be2308aadaf8da5eceb1270600bc64da096a1a80d49fa59659863f",
      "text": "没问题。别看我这样，\n既然要做就会认真做好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d684969c03e3b10d76d9c0fbf81d8e41dd914baf6fc092e6ae1901a06afeca60",
      "text": "（也是为了避免留级……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bff4ba0b9f2be155572d6065dbb045cb0738091483dfebb1837ade3a2d85f616",
      "text": "对了。这是慰劳品甜甜圈。\n就当作是初次见面的心意，大家一起吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_b:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ca58793ff477cbdfe0205aa29be96384f48720e6c2c1972c055624391b27ce",
      "text": "哇——！太棒了！\n拍照吧拍照，拍照——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56c6faa1734a4e20a621fbc9bfc677331c76d5eecafce5e189ab4d09bcb0de2f",
      "text": "既然乐队成员5个人都到齐了，\n今天我想讨论一下今后的方针！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423666962f33b83c992a7a81cf329eb7eb7ef3ea22390094d934a18d5a0469b3",
      "text": "（……哇啊。\n自己说出来，感觉超有模有样的……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4733ae842e7eaf7ba4bcb393e181c08c318c95bf364393856550bdf8e216c860",
      "text": "（很有组乐队挥洒青春的感觉……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93c72a3f01718703615179b244bed232dece0440be13b04fa4841c9b1978420",
      "text": "既然是乐队，果然还是得开演唱会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34c7c60312c46e7c65550dca43aff893d52cee6d15b2685a79fafa6de3e6ff78",
      "text": "……也得，写歌呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f43f275c86b9eb77a0a1bc3f523fc5d9028ef40c4a9f1ef0c99fb8d3cc33db7",
      "text": "还有就是，希望能让更多的人\n听到我们的歌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d81397212ab11a52e8c93aa462b7f778594b2b9fa1da3b3b818f163f6dce6f7",
      "text": "那那那，街头路演怎么样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ace6d0b05724c285d3bb2681009da86e47b01ab192f9fb150277118b9240369f",
      "text": "从街头开始的成名之路……！\n这种设定，简直帅到炸裂啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716017d9c287e8347a616e968957dc2ac6719db7d06ba6ef6bb602de9942a701",
      "text": "不错嘛！\n要是街头路演的话，我们应该马上就能办了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aa78ac9778e42090985961cb82262a074272ee91e55a68a3062ed453614c098",
      "text": "事情可没那么简单。\n街头路演需要办理各种手续和许可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3de641dda0d8428237cca6724f654b45c4cf7502dc50e944e2714a5a52914a7",
      "text": "手续办起来很麻烦，而且……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19055217e1af161feb2b8554f6a609be4363657f22a876fb044e7bb0a297140",
      "text": "总之！我反对街头路演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb26929a157eba2608a344f968d52439c7374f8d2c2bce38cd4542f0b1aaf467",
      "text": "那，这种怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bf025e2a168a534c215d81ad0fd338b1cdef6d503a2531e55060eea8a46a5c7",
      "text": "我找到了这样一张传单。\n“高中生乐队大赛”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b33c6136e03bcc657da4c4f77b494f2887a89198331b2226d5bde8f3d779b6a",
      "text": "高中生乐队大赛！？\n那是什么，感觉让人热血沸腾啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1929c7125b4cc17f53c8f948f4ec47bdd2a69f73df17d3e4a1dfe586cb3d823",
      "text": "说是召集各地高中生乐队的比赛。\n去参加这个怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a946b61babb8973c931aa1154894c1c6e7108f147184a5d9f06699399f8cd85",
      "text": "哦，很好啊！\n只要在这个比赛拿到好成绩，我的留级危机也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd59ec77af36cdb9fce78310993723d99c39d2792852e53793ed9bacd13c7a5",
      "text": "参加大赛太乱来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f4f2e9f990dda87f7f4d00f769629697eddd4ac001fc2e877301ca3d12fdc5b",
      "text": "哎哎——！为什么啊，旬亲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7d2fb532030baaa377688425b4bc107cd30ec97fcdbc3ed2ecf346950b40d9",
      "text": "我们的轻音部，全都是乐器初学者这种外行。\n这样的乐队就算去参赛，也只会自取其辱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca684f529947c2e9b17249d694b76f763b19886d173c79ff974784d35570ee0",
      "text": "会吗？\n我觉得我们其实挺行的啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:973ac8d2731381d909b53d6a664c2eb9ff5ff5a47cf0a58f161ddd45b44156d7",
      "text": "我也这么觉得！\n前辈们的演奏，简直超级MAX厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b52ff7ec28a4bfd95fe3ad652578bd00cf318304138f536ab1bb48f2c2ae4d7",
      "text": "夏来怎么觉得？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ccd33582a62868adcc66a3dffdb5ccde226ea6eb22f84b3bf9b30f71796bd4",
      "text": "我……听旬的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a42a385b1a88da9fc6f4855addaf8fe9ea48d3b2d35220a40dd06ba50bcf93ef",
      "text": "那么，只要旬同意就算通过了对吧！\n来吧，旬！你怎么说！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a9b0826eeeaccdec26149e64c32a0fad3cd886e0493604922d92b2d715ee83b",
      "text": "…………\n我知道了。好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576ca0e715d9875665ab595b16c260efd7133ed2985ecc40df7a9ed969fbc82c",
      "text": "太棒了，就这么定了！\n目标是，拿下冠军——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118aee67a2c5c58c34b2ac9a4245cc64e699c55fae3e2a7d526bd3d2967f6821",
      "text": "……一上来就要夺冠，怎么可能做到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a504eca3cc9dc6667ac9a15e9cbaeb0154b1e2795936f16955a9542b169ad00f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我是不是有点耍帅过头了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9076fb5400781ec8bdf755290d6abd045120a1570e9d45c68e45d30189ea973",
      "text": "就是耍帅过头了。\n我们实力不够是不争的事实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e47c82c21a7b7206d3b720cd449b5a00ab6b65c5f15e7ad1c1eeb93fa2bcbee5",
      "text": "确实。今后必须多加练习才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89310f31d215f7b9b59fa0e3fb53c0b02f26d1ea9afa2ab02a5032951107c066",
      "text": "我刚刚才开始学架子鼓，赶得及吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b17f1b508ca7a3ccf344ddde0ea388bedfd2bee57447c86a91e1eb4d82c0c35",
      "text": "没事的！我和夏来也是加入社团之后，\n才开始学吉他和贝斯的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405e464fee7c5b083b3a79e8b7a0c96b4e2500d3a769effb7ed354c19c323bf5",
      "text": "春名只要多练习也会变厉害的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3bb41c3092dbeeb99af50c2303aa2001fc453c785ac0ce6c01f2e55ae66d6fe",
      "text": "旬亲以前就一直在弹键盘吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c25bcc6ab451cc37607b89d03575659e998c2d61dd1adae14d003e4cb0c1bfb",
      "text": "旬……会弹钢琴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5b1cff80e8e7eab03bf90ded090ac20f4d076b753943e6e69c58e8a548e606",
      "text": "钢琴！？好厉害！\n旬亲，太帅了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf43991971f1cedcf54744fcabf6dff5cadf7a5ef6cafdacbf18a4e5daa80acb",
      "text": "……！嗯……！\n……嗝。……嗝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3dbfd6649072619f39c7aa9a29d6a6cfc5bb7bf483f28a46882df9e32275b72",
      "text": "！？怎、怎么了，夏来亲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38618a58dc5363cbb2a20e4ac911075fee9313be825b571179c1a5a7becb8b23",
      "text": "想起……旬弹钢琴的样子……\n太感动了……开始打嗝……嗝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55d75bd32a611e9bd8d53532045544c407ebfec5ac2b7953a5d91d602f2dff0a",
      "text": "糟、糟糕了！\n旬，像平时那样帮他停下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:541388cd9e97d0805d7d141b8b40c1944ce649bb5e9f4d42ed9b096662790aa8",
      "text": "真是的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47d327aca15686ce4d66cd269e8d73c9ee135599980cc8637b7bfe59324e2ae0",
      "text": "这个，按这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54a242048531aaec07b8ef13c1b31fbdbe6536e41ce4a677abc4440aa4a5aa1a",
      "text": "咚！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb2eeb7a8d0166a20c8f0ae09b09bbf75286c4c50bf8afe7c6ddbbb6b07ae0c",
      "text": "谢谢……旬……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b88afc42792699bfe3efe1a52cc107a6e624fe73c171b5d66aae162d97bd9ac",
      "text": "呼，太好了。夏来的打嗝，\n除了旬没人能止得住啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f025b1aa0ef040ceab71540dadf8089a2eee0816e75732049520b45ad99649f",
      "text": "居然感动到打嗝停不下来……\n旬亲的钢琴，有那么厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddecfa24953626b63dd59d6c8c120ab6907ca746e54611af2cd850ef11a501a9",
      "text": "旬在初中的时候，\n可是被叫做“神童·冬美旬”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60515bffd4ce3d45fc363ba9675148541012ab45d9fb3ef0872e5467d49cb8a7",
      "text": "神童！？那也太超级帅了吧！\n怪不得键盘弹得那么好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646feaac7e0a967eb097e8dd4eeebcdb9bf3c5dbd373e38e42454cfa4d5361cc",
      "text": "……并没有。没什么大不了的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:877868c04b355d693102f04c337f6fbbc21a55eb4c652ed735eb7a27632fba28",
      "text": "还有，钢琴和键盘是两种不同的乐器。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bcbd741df56d87a2c499be12c0c55ecddd38b63a164c5f66761371fa78b14f4",
      "text": "……钢琴是原声乐器，\n就算没有电也可以单独演奏发声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:333658321c053a64f9de75f30cfb0bcd8a5d8c814df90b5a0e74d94d644e7fc8",
      "text": "尤其是钢琴从用手指按下琴键到发出声音的\n结构来看，兼具了打击乐器和弦乐器的特征",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:369c8ac10a55091829b03619e028d791536410ae869058a10f9191739afa1a16",
      "text": "因而被归类为击弦乐器……讲到这里\n应该能明白吧？更详细说明的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd09af90b73d2839db5d61aec430ee66f86e17a0678748220e7d38aef261814",
      "text": "……？呃……\n抱歉，能用甜甜圈来打比方说明吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955818105b18bf6c83027f5935820c212a9a2e2e94a9f17402cb55acb982f872",
      "text": "哇……哇啊～～～！\n脑袋要爆炸了，求求你饶了我吧～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98611fc21144823f2ced52890a6da2a9964ad2fffd42c91f3164a6000a1f31ad",
      "text": "……！\n咳咳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_f:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3dd992bc4dab21ff4f31e57b23c3f83f0fe2f039828d0e3efffa9bc0d888cc9",
      "text": "果然呢。你们两个人，必须得先从学生必学的\n基础科目开始补习才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c47bf22affe705887efde1db188b74170dda83df1b5f66a9e70838430f54a6bc",
      "text": "呜呜……难道说，\n我已经暴露我是个笨蛋了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4ffdd02c6bfe1ea9b670e0acaf8204c9e21882708ff442c344d7345d5964180",
      "text": "只要看着就一清二楚了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7836ff080da9e1fb54b7d86726fd8502d6606acd4df6f83e4fafd987012df6e8",
      "text": "话说回来，聊社团聊得起劲是没关系，\n但学生的本分是学习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ab8a6f468f619f51c2136c835290fb8896d9a0c7fee4e80788ed5f2b0c82be",
      "text": "绝不能因为练习过头\n而导致成绩下滑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2f23434e6fe05f1effe0b2c07b9a42780ff6eb8c449adbb0b4bbfc82e5da486",
      "text": "补课和补考绝对不行。\n要是影响到升学出路该怎么办。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6bb141042816aafee42bc1b9f88ff40662311242adf72a914eb1ffd5489cd1",
      "text": "啊哈哈……旬好严厉啊～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3d46fe503f073976cc3b3b967779c9bd601354aaa2e36d3c578f5aa54a8a3f",
      "text": "这是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32a7d4b868327d76bad3b7832f33f1054f918cc68e8fc999ceeca39c7edaf26",
      "text": "嗯……学习也要，加油哦……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7cf53d01b6875d0e7e4c1d27b58091167b21cf45d2141ef32cb8baf03b187e",
      "text": "这、这个话题差不多可以打住了吧？\n接下来聊聊写歌的事情吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fa7270127aa7afb96689adf383a7664a1a87819161aee41bada9d7359c704ba",
      "text": "对、对啊！聊那个更好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6c22c9511151e8bc06e390dced81777597d495217ba0dbe03da5d3972926490",
      "text": "……尤其是看起来最危险的春名先生和四季君。\n你们现在的成绩到底怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5c38762cad3bf4f0dd7ef733df5a094c83c44fb54be72da27234c9436b5b4a",
      "text": "呃……我嘛～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18e94c6bf4fa0c98284549e3b15ce16d0cd6152fe87da4a10fb467d61e5a2bdb",
      "text": "啊，抱歉。关于春名先生，\n就算不问我也心知肚明了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47491f620026067ab4b31c44f6de98be118321306ac17a6de3921dd7bb8cf510",
      "text": "凭什么啊——！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06b56439c4c270f43c353aa794b542fe5b4f1c0d0c40a88d2441534202d9b910",
      "text": "毕竟留级了两次嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83e6b7b414ae25e0aebef93d36842ed75ee7f7155eb7571a6b33e99de17122e1",
      "text": "是因为打工太忙了啦！\n这也是没办法的吧——！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:556d5133b57cffd0d8bd76bca1f083e6f9d27b21ac1442a5b4642fb69a6b893b",
      "text": "四季君又如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae5065a296ec6a60dc2a5bd442812b47f03df8ccdf6c3ab25966baacda571c3c",
      "text": "我、我嘛……其实今天进行的\n数学小测验，我逃掉了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a71e9793d4a87cea4891d4ac07b61705cd7b92cd04bbaaae0ebdc67211b31447",
      "text": "哎——！\n那可是为了分班准备的重要测试啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3543efe5b9df1e5cf6036ed94f6f16d21c945c6490371e18c762e4873fff7cf",
      "text": "可是！我真的完全不会做嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733450032b1e8eb8218a53bc13cb114a70c10194882bf593a6d15ca895201dc7",
      "text": "……说、说起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d0172fb9cc2a16addc623578bd5089224d2f85db8c9fb14f8e82a1c123a1e7",
      "text": "前几天在教职工办公室，好像听到老师们在讨论\n“有个一年级生正全速朝着若里路线狂奔”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a5eba54285406c5af86f87dc63bdd4169281ce1778da9480caea6be2efbbdc",
      "text": "恐怕说的就是四季君吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:099b38504a6b656e9182a875ec97af55538d412c642fb583598c166b32d529a1",
      "text": "喂喂，若里路线是个什么鬼啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:229b27a90a028b324ec6062e271242a81447d6da7ab1620c817e478699bc1fcc",
      "text": "那说这话的隼人亲又怎么样！\n你学习，很好吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a79a7e1d6aa445365483a7bf994adb57402c60c6713dcd2f305ce4f9c26179",
      "text": "我、我很普通啦。\n大概就是不上不下的感觉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1db90db609da85ff978c9290113c361d7a421ca956399d293b25e01094464699",
      "text": "哇啊，那种最无聊了。\n完全就是平平无奇嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a7fd9aa2130ef69227e0573f3a9687f6308db4e794d4279b2e321b20942e1e",
      "text": "你这家伙——！很伤人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e735a13fd9aad618fee224268ee728f214597e13a4dd8726ec2016351695446e",
      "text": "今天定下了社团的目标……太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a30fc54d9b5b99470d44dd98085e118793e1b6d5051c49cf677640d84e56b1",
      "text": "是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78000fb13c3e8dd339b01cb6087f790908c948a1767201d5d797ce89d75ad4ae",
      "text": "旬……怎么了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90f6f1cd931d21712ace200c2a7efb4898019bcd25de1f47348b274727718ed7",
      "text": "我在担心那两个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7e41b7ab62beda4d21de819bb58c5bb6fc145ce99866fdc459ffc616f1ea294",
      "text": "是指四季和，春名吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ede87ba28dd49cd7821fd5d1a5cdce6a00f8cb0405cba38119eed29c380bbe9",
      "text": "一个是逃避考试的高一生，一个是留级两次的高二生。\n更何况两个人都对音乐一窍不通。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c75ca37644ed249559096cbdc6f0d94c23163b22c572b0a8dbbbc86f8fef2158",
      "text": "带着这种成员去参加大赛，\n反正迟早要吃苦头的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d9ced7d54f6b6ef11b1eb898a57a9f892af6f51dfc4ffecea11fbd3fcf83412",
      "text": "旬……其实很关心他们两个呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eda1538fb8b4f2d926dfcf0fd4c2b5956571d9073c18ee37c7c0035c90f66181",
      "text": "才不是。\n我只是不想被卷进补课和补考里去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0ac36e2066248a6778e01e2eee515b9962db7a0a4b353f6d2b804e55dad0fc",
      "text": "我可不想惹上麻烦事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f5246ba1682ee7bdb3b4a496dcbc053b50741d10a63fe1f79f3d1b579cd16f",
      "text": "一定……没问题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebf1705240542784cdcfb5ab9daf2dd45482c6b10386f4b6864fc09abd4cec4",
      "text": "你还真是乐观啊，夏来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfcdfdeb2e99a3fe911e7f3e738471c5fa28f857b2cffbe4cdc0993a9c28f6c1",
      "text": "因为能听到旬的演奏……我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6cf1a2f1afdc9641125e61b1933b52e2ed302026d35d10fecfe313b9cc7e32",
      "text": "从第一次听到开始，就一直……\n我，很喜欢旬的钢琴，所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5e4d976612e39c47a168452d58315c4a54037475c29b9fb0c72cc4a8434023",
      "text": "所以……我也会努力的。\n无论是学习，还是练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1042d30a276a7de5e719079c05c63005b0053dad67bf158c5480d272f7aafaa1",
      "text": "为了能一直留在旬的身边……\n聆听旬的琴声……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f25caaf4e1dffe5ba8b6e4491e14e5d6b2f846f7bdff014f387637a47e8fda4",
      "text": "……在说什么啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6602a3fd24c206254df299fe289d9a47cea3be7564ea4453cacbd12ae9f98cd1",
      "text": "话说，\n我都说了键盘和钢琴不一样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62a436493dd21ed1a662dd4431ca6efb06c38b5b7633cc60d43dc194d1a172d",
      "text": "呵呵……说得，也是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61a26fc03825d53e45b16d86945a85667d1e5b19a663199524e7811c04d6682d",
      "text": "……我既然要做，就会做出成绩。\n因为我不想出丑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df30904a32f37708101ff0e097d276906101d0eca9ef0d5b3de2e980f367471",
      "text": "和另外三个人不同，夏来应该没问题。\n但也不要太松懈了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d9281d11f7ed766d36d9977d8893b568a8e560e571ece2d7b452b9338c7a28",
      "text": "嗯……大家一起，加油，吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
